{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step back into the prehistoric age for a short, light-hearted rescue mission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Jurassic Wrap, your goal is simple: save the baby dinosaur eggs and make it safely to the exit portal. Along the way you\u2019ll leap, dodge, and use clever screen-wrapping mechanics to outsmart threats and discover new ways through each level.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/6f276f750e0a73036d584ce12a4b3679.poster.avif?t=1764951137\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/6f276f750e0a73036d584ce12a4b3679.webm?t=1764951137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/6f276f750e0a73036d584ce12a4b3679.mp4?t=1764951137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t about fighting dinosaurs \u2014 it\u2019s about protecting them! With colourful visuals, approachable gameplay, and just the right amount of danger, Jurassic Wrap is fun for kids, families, and anyone who loves classic arcade-style platformers.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/85fec97aa527bab22852bddce14acbec.poster.avif?t=1764951137\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/85fec97aa527bab22852bddce14acbec.webm?t=1764951137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/85fec97aa527bab22852bddce14acbec.mp4?t=1764951137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd5a Rescue the Eggs \u2013 Collect baby dinosaur eggs to complete each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 Screen-Wrap Gameplay \u2013 Walk off one side of the screen and pop back on the other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd96 Face Prehistoric Dangers \u2013 Avoid hazards and threats while finding the exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc66 Made by a Father &amp; Son Duo \u2013 A unique project created with love and heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Family-Friendly Fun \u2013 Easy to play, fun to master, and safe for kids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Classic Arcade Vibes \u2013 Simple controls, colourful visuals, and timeless gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/572b1f96675b21796d52d4e10b08f3e9.poster.avif?t=1764951137\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/572b1f96675b21796d52d4e10b08f3e9.webm?t=1764951137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094150/extras/572b1f96675b21796d52d4e10b08f3e9.mp4?t=1764951137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to the Jungle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4094150/0a6d274637e8b85cb562184cc943318c1225d2a1.jpg"},{"name":"Nightfall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4094150/530a93744803824bdaee52205e52c6918d9e9275.jpg"},{"name":"Daylight Returns","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4094150/032b7116c69a59dc6545be2216c478899fbf1f45.jpg"},{"name":"Tutorial Titan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/